window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/hpc-v27-046-4b3d4f1fea96701e.json"]={sha256:"4b3d4f1fea96701e44b855aae185da5b773bd9977c0e174f3e5b535b5c3eaba3",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v27-case-95d717ba7201260a","url":"https://www.opencompute.org/projects/rack-and-power/","title":"Rack and Power","titleEn":"Rack and Power","publisher":"Open Compute Project","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"hpc-v27-046","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"hpc-v27-046","related":[{"id":"hpc-v27-047","referenceUrls":["https://www.opencompute.org/projects/rack-and-power/"],"title":"雙路供電：共同祖先與最小切集","titleEn":"Dual power paths: common ancestors and minimal cut sets","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付降額表、三個單失效情境、正常/失效容量對照與不等容量反例；不操作實際電源；請同學只使用交付件重算兩組，保留失敗案例與限制；全程使用合成檔案，不對生產系統執行故障。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver derating records, three single-failure cases, normal-versus-failed capacity and the unequal-module counterexample. The exercise does not switch or disconnect physical power equipment. Have a peer reproduce both configurations from the artifacts, retaining failed cases and limitations. Use synthetic files throughout; never inject these faults into a production system.","difference":"建立 source、UPS、PDU、load 有向圖，每負載列出 A/B 路徑；標記共同祖先而非僅著色兩條線。","differenceEn":"Build a directed source, UPS, PDU and load graph with explicit A/B paths. Identify common ancestors instead of simply drawing the two paths in different colors.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["單失效餘裕為 (模組數-1)*每模組可用容量-負載；正值只證明此容量模型，不包含切換瞬態與配電限制；三個模組各可用 3 kW；負載名義 8 kW、變更 5 kW；可用值已含本課所有降額；名義式 (3-1)*3-8 = -2 kW margin after one loss；變更式 (3-1)*3-5 = 1 kW margin after one loss。所有數值、限制與門檻為原創合成教學條件；來源支援概念與介面，不代表實機量測或設備規格。","每負載至少一條完整來源路徑存活才可用；移除指定元件後，以圖可達性計算無路徑負載數；十六負載名義的兩路都依賴 UPS-X；變更後八負載改具獨立 Y 路徑，其餘八仍只依賴 X；事件為 X 失效；名義式 8+8 = 16 loads disconnected；變更式 16-8 = 8 loads disconnected。所有數值、限制與門檻為原創合成教學條件；來源支援概念與介面，不代表實機量測或設備規格。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Single-failure margin equals (module count-1) times usable module capacity minus load. Positive margin proves this capacity condition only, excluding transfer transients, distribution limits and common failures. Use three modules with 3 kW usable output each. Load changes from 8 to 5 kW; the declared usable value already includes all derating in this fixture. Nominal (3-1)*3-8 = -2 kW margin after one loss; changed (3-1)*3-5 = 1 kW margin after one loss. Every numeric input, limit and threshold is an original synthetic teaching condition. References establish concepts and interfaces, not measured machine results or equipment specifications.","A load remains available only if at least one complete source path survives. Remove the specified component and use reachability to count disconnected loads, rather than counting plugs or cables. All sixteen loads initially depend on UPS-X through both apparent paths. After changing the graph, eight gain an independent path through Y while eight still depend only on X. The event removes X. Nominal 8+8 = 16 loads disconnected; changed 16-8 = 8 loads disconnected. Every numeric input, limit and threshold is an original synthetic teaching condition. References establish concepts and interfaces, not measured machine results or equipment specifications.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"hpc-v27-056","referenceUrls":["https://gpaw.readthedocs.io/documentation/grids.html"],"title":"GPAW：實空間網格精化與積分不變量","titleEn":"GPAW: real-space grid refinement and integral invariants","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付降額表、三個單失效情境、正常/失效容量對照與不等容量反例；不操作實際電源；請同學只使用交付件重算兩組，保留失敗案例與限制；全程使用合成檔案，不對生產系統執行故障。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver derating records, three single-failure cases, normal-versus-failed capacity and the unequal-module counterexample. The exercise does not switch or disconnect physical power equipment. Have a peer reproduce both configurations from the artifacts, retaining failed cases and limitations. Use synthetic files throughout; never inject these faults into a production system.","difference":"使用原創合成資料研究「GPAW：實空間網格精化與積分不變量」，從物理或資料契約推導計算，並以反例驗證。完成：交付格點索引、兩種網格記憶體下界、積分核對與精化敏感度表。","differenceEn":"Investigate GPAW: real-space grid refinement and integral invariants using an original synthetic fixture. Derive the calculation from its physical or data contract, challenge it with a counterexample, and defend a bounded conclusion. Complete: Deliver index conventions, storage lower bounds for both grids, integral checks and an observable-refinement table that distinguishes requested spacing from the actual discretization.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["單失效餘裕為 (模組數-1)*每模組可用容量-負載；正值只證明此容量模型，不包含切換瞬態與配電限制；三個模組各可用 3 kW；負載名義 8 kW、變更 5 kW；可用值已含本課所有降額；名義式 (3-1)*3-8 = -2 kW margin after one loss；變更式 (3-1)*3-5 = 1 kW margin after one loss。所有數值、限制與門檻為原創合成教學條件；來源支援概念與介面，不代表實機量測或設備規格。","計算兩種 N 的三次方，再分別乘八 bytes；把單場值數與軟體的峰值使用量分開。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Single-failure margin equals (module count-1) times usable module capacity minus load. Positive margin proves this capacity condition only, excluding transfer transients, distribution limits and common failures. Use three modules with 3 kW usable output each. Load changes from 8 to 5 kW; the declared usable value already includes all derating in this fixture. Nominal (3-1)*3-8 = -2 kW margin after one loss; changed (3-1)*3-5 = 1 kW margin after one loss. Every numeric input, limit and threshold is an original synthetic teaching condition. References establish concepts and interfaces, not measured machine results or equipment specifications.","Cube each one-dimensional count and multiply by eight bytes for a single double-precision field. Keep this arithmetic separate from peak application memory, which may contain multiple fields, states, padding and temporary buffers.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v27-case-95d717ba7201260a","url":"https://www.opencompute.org/projects/rack-and-power/","title":"Rack and Power","titleEn":"Rack and Power","publisher":"Open Compute Project","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v27-case-cf20a46f3ea82fbf","url":"https://gpaw.readthedocs.io/documentation/grids.html","title":"GPAW computational grids","titleEn":"GPAW computational grids","publisher":"GPAW","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
